# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# DB-030/DB-021: a window entry raises its window and CMD+click minimizes
# it -- reachable at last: a CMD press on the bar is ARMED for the dock
# drag and delivered as the chord only when it never moves.
wait 12
note the folder window is up, white where its list is
expect-pixel 275 200 ffffff
click 932 60 1 ctrl
wait 20
note CMD+click on its Deskbar entry minimized it: backdrop shows through
expect-pixel 275 200 336698
click 932 60 1
wait 20
note and a plain click on the same entry brings it back
expect-pixel 275 200 ffffff
quit
